Package: protsea
Title: Exchange and Visualize Proteomics Enrichment Results
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Witold", "Wolski", , "wew@fgcz.ethz.ch", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Exchanges STRING and clusterProfiler enrichment results through
    a shared JSON format. Preserves native GSEA statistics and ranked inputs
    for reconstruction of enrichment plots and running-score curves.
